{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Normalize sampling into the documented half-open interval**\n\nDividing by `0xffffffff` maps the maximum unsigned hash to exactly `1.0`, contradicting the documented `[0,1)` range and shifting deterministic boundary decisions. Divide by `2^32` (`0x1_0000_0000L`) and add shared fixed-vector tests, coordinating the boundary change with the other SDK implementations.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7pooLY","finding_digest":"e7d59d7f97adf9275b8c6059f365d1f81f01b4bd532c18412ba85b880824af36","finding_id":"arf_v1_47kz274xvx4sow4mmbm7gzor7a","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::shouldsample::unit-interval-normalization","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::shouldsample::unit-interval-normalization","line":430,"observation_digest":"c810dc886e497f93551240719bbc2d2ae7adab28f948e7811f70fad1cc58fbf2","observation_id":"aro_v1_zainzcdojf7zgvisibyzxpbnfl","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_47kz274xvx4sow4mmbm7gzor7a","published_at":"2026-09-02T23:48:39Z","review_id":"arr_v1_brd3pfs5righqijat55m42wkqi","reviewed_base_sha":"54b01c910cb06c69336afcb2c5f3f220fbe7b0b0","reviewed_head_sha":"3b6eb771df61db642c999e1d308344c97b3cf686","reviewer":"codex","start_line":430,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_ensw3ptxuagnnga5ber4ruenbj","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-02T23:48:39Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
